          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.29.2+1SA.29.3+1SA.29.4+1SA.29.5+1SA.29.6+1SA.29.7+1SA.29.8+1SA.29.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 29:2-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi no mu Bamanase har’ abācīkiye Dawidi, igihe yajana n’ Abafilisitiya bagiye gutera Sauli; mugabo ntiyabafasha, kukw abaganwa b’Abafilisitiya, bamaze kuja inama baciye bamurungika, bati Yohava aduta, agaherēra ku ruhande rwa shebuja Sauli, natwe ntituhokore agatwe kacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw akiri mu nzira asubira i Sikulagi, abo bantu bo mu Bamanase bāciye bamucīkira, ni bo aba: Aduna na Yozabadi na Yediyayeli na Mikayeli na Yozabadi na Elihu na Siletayi, abakuru bo mu mazu y’Abamanase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.30.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 30:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabara Dawidi, barwanya ca gitero c’abanyazi; bose bār’ abahizi, kandi bār’ abagabisha b’ingabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko, uko bukeye hama haza abantu kuri Dawidi bo kumurwanira, gushitsa aho bāhindutse ingabo nyinshi, zihwanye n’iz’ Imana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
