            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iki ni co gitigiri c’imice y’ingabo zaje gushengerera Dawidi i Heburoni zitwaje ibirwanishwa, ngo zimusubize ku ngoma ya Sauli, nk’ukw ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryavuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu Bayuda bitwaje inkinzo n’amacumu bār’ ibihumbi bitandatu n’amajana munani biteguye kurwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu Basimeyoni, abantu b’abahizi b’abanyentambara, bār’ ibihumbi ndwi n’ijana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu Balewi bār’ ibihumbi bine n’amajana atandatu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yehoyada, umukuru w’ab’ inzu ya Aroni, azanana n’ibihumbi bitatu n’amajana ndwi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.8.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 8:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 6:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haza na Sadoki, yar’ umusore w’umuhizi, azanana n’abagabisha mirongwibiri na babiri bo mu nzu ya sekuruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.2.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 2:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 12:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu Babenyamini b’i wabo wa Sauli bār’ ibihumbi bitatu; kuko gushitsa ico gihe abenshi muri bo bāri bagiherereye ku nzu ya Sauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu Befurayimu bār’ ibihumbi mirongwibiri n’amajana munani, abantu b’abahizi, ba rurangiranwa mu mazu ya ba sekuruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab’ igihimba c’ umuryango wa Manase bār’ ibihumbi cumi n’umunani, kand’ abo bāri bavuzwe amazina ngo baje kwimika Dawidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.1.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 1:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.16.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 16:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu Bisakari bazi ubgenge bgo kumenya ibihe, bakamenya n’ivyo Abisirayeli bakwiye gukora, bār’ abakuru amajana abiri, bāzananye n’ abandi b’i wabo bāgaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu Bazebuloni bār’ ibihumbi mirongwitanu, bashobora kuja mu ntambara, bakamenya uburyo bgo gutondesha urugamba no kurwanisha ibirwanishwa vy’uburyo bgose, bama biteguye gutabara badafise imitima ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu Banafutali bār’ abagabisha igihumbi, bari kumwe n’abitwaje inkinzo n’amacumu ibihumbi mirongwitatu n’indwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu Badani bazi uburyo bgo gutondesha urugamba bār’ ibihumbi mirongwibiri n’umunani n’amajana atandatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mu Basheri bashobora kuja mu ntambara, bakamenya uburyo bgo gutondesha urugamba, bār’ ibihumbi mirongwine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’abo hakurya ya Yorodani, abo mu Bareyubeni no mu Bagadi no mu gihimba c’ umuryango w’Abamanase, biteguye kurwana bafise ibirwanishwa vy’uburyo bgose, bār’ ibihumbi ijana na mirongwibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo banyentambara bose, abantu bazi gutondesha urugamba, ni bo baje i Heburoni bahūje imitima, bazanywe no kwimika Dawidi ngw abe umwami w’Abisirayeli bose; mbere n’abandi Bisirayeli bose bāri bahūje imitima ngo bimike Dawidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bamara gatatu bari ngaho nyene kwa Dawidi, barya, banywa, kuko bagenzi babo bāri babiteguriye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n’abāba hafi yaho, mber’ ugashitsa n’i Bgisakari n’i Buzebuloni n’i Bunafutali, bazanye ingemurano baziremētse indogoba n’ingamiya n’ inyumbu n’inka, ingemurano z’ amafu, n’uturobe tubumbabumbge mu nsukoni, n’imisoko y’ inzabibu zumye, na vino, n’amavuta ya elayo, n’inka n’intama vyinshi cane; kuko hār’ akanyamuneza mu Bisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
